Package: volume-booster
Version: 1.1.4
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-pyqt6, pulseaudio-utils
Maintainer: Vanguard Arts SRL <https://vanguardarts.vip/>
Homepage: https://github.com/VanguardArts/volume-booster
Description: system tray volume booster for quiet audio
 Boost the default audio output above 100% using PipeWire/PulseAudio
 software gain. Useful for YouTube videos and other sources that are
 inherently quiet even when every volume slider is at maximum.
 .
 Left-click the tray icon to open a 0-200% slider; right-click for
 quick presets (100-200%) and reset.
